"""037.md batch W: deepen vv 78, 111, 131, 157.

All four bodies were verified correct against their own verses before rewriting,
so this is depth work only. Each is written on a different portion of the shared
apparatus so it does not duplicate a neighbour:

  v78  takes the remembrance (IK), the story left as a sign for the worlds
       (29:15; cf. 54:15), and the wider list of Noah accounts from the shared
       [75-82] note. v77 already covers the progeny enduring and v79 the peace
       throughout the worlds, so neither is repeated.
  v111 the refrain's SECOND occurrence, placed immediately after the sacrifice
       -- servanthood as what that trial established. v110 already carries the
       parallel list for the recompense refrain.
  v131 the refrain's fifth occurrence in its EMPHATIC form ("Thus indeed"), and
       what the accumulation of five establishes. v80 (batch T) already covers
       29:69c and the reward-of-goodness principle at 42:23 / 55:60, so neither
       is repeated here.
  v157 the demand to produce the Book, and the two-fold reproach structure that
       pairs vv. 154-55 (no intellectual proofs) with vv. 156-157 (no revealed
       source). v156 already glosses "manifest authority" and lists its six
       cross-references, so that is not repeated.

Guards: no verbatim re-quote of the verse in the opening prose; no verbatim
repeat of blockquote wording in the prose above it; echo the verse's own
distinctive vocabulary; paragraphs distinct so duprate stays under 0.025.
"""

